<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Norcen Energy raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Norcen Energy raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said analyst Jim Mecca raised the rating on Amber Energy Inc and Norcen Energy Resources Ltd to trading buy from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Amber was unchanged at C23.50, and Norcen rose C$0.30 to C$27.95 on the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- analyst declined to comment.</p>
</text>
